  "about": "Pinned third-party inputs of the Lean C tier (scripts/lean-dist/build-tiers.mjs --c). Lean's release ships its clang without C library headers and with only a few compiler headers; the C tier adds clang's complete resource headers (from the LLVM release matching Lean's clang) and, on Linux and Windows, C library headers, so packages' bundled C compiles without a system compiler. macOS uses the SDK of the Xcode Command Line Tools, which may not be redistributed.",
